# Guiding Principles

* Unreal Engine 5 is the world editor.
* Creation Kit is the gameplay editor.
* Unreal Engine 5 is the single source of truth for world data.
* Generated worldspaces are derived artifacts and may be regenerated at any time.
* Landscape is imported directly from Unreal Engine's native Landscape system.
* Cells are assigned automatically from world coordinates.
* The importer synchronizes only world data.
* The framework is asset agnostic.
* Import is deterministic.
* The framework never attempts to repair user mistakes.
* The workflow is designed for continuous iteration throughout production.

