# Conclusion

The Unreal Engine 5 → Creation Kit World Import Framework combines the strengths of both tools.

Unreal Engine 5 provides a modern environment for building large worlds, while Creation Kit remains responsible for gameplay, quests, AI, scripting, and final content authoring.

By separating world creation from gameplay development, the framework enables a faster, more iterative, and more maintainable production pipeline for Creation Engine projects.

