# Source of Truth

The Unreal Engine project is the authoritative representation of the world.

The generated Creation Engine worldspace is a derived artifact.

Changes to world geometry performed inside Creation Kit are not synchronized back to Unreal Engine and are expected to be overwritten by subsequent imports.

Gameplay data authored inside Creation Kit is intentionally excluded from synchronization.
